{"title":"1963 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problem 27","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_27&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> varies directly as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/e/ccedc2f7ab3f66b36d3e0cf1536a3c801f01f421.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"18\" height=\"16\" /> and if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/2/d72c739bd8c2b60ef756afaf71e48afd30a74938.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A=5$\" width=\"46\" height=\"13\" /> when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/4/b3456e26e699a87010a259430bc746b565961a17.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B=3,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"52\" height=\"16\" /> then the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/4/3b4f61c4e3bc9e35e10899401a682e400d8e0913.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B=15$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"56\" height=\"13\" /> is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/e/58ed5bd2c5a019aa75690a109ee7bea97146a385.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)} \\quad 25 \\quad \\text{(B)} \\quad 50 \\quad \\text{(C)} \\quad 75 \\quad \\text{(D)} \\quad 3/5 \\quad \\text{(E)} \\quad 5/3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"382\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_27&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Write this as a proportion: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/7/4174c5b92e7ca3355dafad38f40a30bfcdf9cbdb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{A}{B}=\\frac{5}{3}=\\frac{x}{15}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"106\" height=\"38\" /> We get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/9/8b9c3ea959dd6401ce06138160cb595109ee3064.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A = \\boxed{\\text{(A)} \\quad 25}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"113\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_27&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Mathematics_Contests\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Mathematics Contests\">1963 TMTA High School Mathematics Contests</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems\">Problems</a>)</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"30%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_26\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problem 26\"> Problem 26</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"40%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=TMTA_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_Past_Problems/Solutions\" title=\"TMTA High School Mathematics Contest Past Problems/Solutions\">TMTA High School Mathematics Contest Past Problems/Solutions</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"30%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_28\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problem 28\">Problem 28</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018041601\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.014 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.020 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 74/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 661/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 305/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1715/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.271      1 Template:Succession_box\n100.00%    7.271      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:20671:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018041601 and revision id 144628. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}